I have run irace on some problems and it outputted some top 6 configurations for my algorithm. But when I try my algorithm with the top 2 configurations, on all training instances, the configuration in 2nd position (irace) is actually better than the configuration in 1st position. Does irace not use all the training instances when comparing the final results or what is going on?

